data value_quote_escape_dissolution_trigger: String = "dissolve-on (two gaps): (1) SerializationKnobs.value_quote is a wrap-char (concat(q,t,q)), NOT RFC-8259 JSON or TOML string escaping — a value containing a double-quote or newline produces silently invalid output; dissolution = real string-escape authority citing RFC 8259 §7 (JSON) and TOML v1.0 §String (TOML) in std.serialize. (2) ScalarValue { text: String } lacks typed scalars — Int/Bool values serialize as quoted strings (e.g. runner_count '4' not 4), making json_record_knobs non-conforming JSON the moment a real typed consumer arrives; dissolution = split SerialValue into TypedScalar { kind: ScalarKind, text: String } where ScalarKind = StringKind | NumberKind | BoolKind drives value_quote elision; no live bug today (manifest values are all stringified by to_string() at the call site)"
